{"suttaId":"tha-ap49","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3760,3775],"vripara":"88"},"segments":{"tha-ap49:0.3":"Sayanadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap49:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, mettacittassa tādino;","tha-ap49:1.3":"Sayanaggaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, dussabhaṇḍehi [dussabhaṇḍena (syā.)] atthataṃ.","tha-ap49:2.1":"“Paṭiggahesi bhagavā, kappiyaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","tha-ap49:2.3":"Uṭṭhāya sayanā [āsanā (sī.)] tamhā, vehāsaṃ uggamī jino.","tha-ap49:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ sayanamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap49:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, sayanassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap49:4.1":"“Ekapaññāsito kappe, varako [varuṇo (sī. syā.)] devasavhayo;","tha-ap49:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap49:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap49:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sayanadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap49:7.1":"Sayanadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2521,"to":2521,"paras":[{"para":2521,"vripara":"88","refs":["tha-ap49:1"],"words":["siddhatthassa bhagavato"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>siddhatthassa bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ pāḷinayānusārena suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap49:1"],["tha-ap49:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
